 song,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l014","ordinal":298475,"en":"I confirm my secret:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l015","ordinal":298476,"en":"Today I will stop at the kashatka,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l016","ordinal":298477,"en":"Cucumber left over from the hero"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l017","ordinal":298478,"en":"I feel like I have no pain."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l018","ordinal":298479,"en":"Let me bite my tongue"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l019","ordinal":298480,"en":"Try my face, baby"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l020","ordinal":298481,"en":"I met him outside."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l021","ordinal":298482,"en":"Criticize me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l022","ordinal":298483,"en":"I will release my sadness."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l023","ordinal":298484,"en":"My remaining testament,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l024","ordinal":298485,"en":"The som ax left from the noble,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l025","ordinal":298486,"en":"My big back from Aikol,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l026","ordinal":298487,"en":"I wander in the mud"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l027","ordinal":298488,"en":"The blackness left from the hero."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l028","ordinal":298489,"en":"Look at it, Seitek"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l029","ordinal":298490,"en":"I'm going to burn."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l030","ordinal":298491,"en":"I'm hanging out,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l031","ordinal":298492,"en":"Erenim saa, I say,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l032","ordinal":298493,"en":"I'm lonely"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l033","ordinal":298494,"en":"I will come back again."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l034","ordinal":298495,"en":"Kyzytalak Kyazga"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0074:b003:l035","ordinal":298496,"en":"ever since ever"}]
